# Cryptic Caves: "{1}, {T}, Sacrifice this land: Draw a card. Activate only if you control five or more lands." An
# Icetill Explorer (two land drops a turn) lets Bot1 reach lands quickly. Turn 1: Forest, the Explorer (Mox Emerald's and
# the Forest's green, Mox Pearl and Mox Jet), and Cryptic Caves as the second land. Turn 3: two Islands, four lands in all:
# the draw ability is refused although the Caves and a Mox for the {1} are untapped. Turn 5: a fifth land, and the Caves
# is one of the five (ruling 2019-07-12), so it is activated and, sacrificed, leaves four lands: Bot1 draws a card.

